title: "The TomeVault Instruction Corpus"
abstract: >-
  Open, de-identified monthly measurements of the AI instruction files teams
  commit to their repositories (CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, SKILL.md, .cursorrules
  and related conventions). No file contents, owner names, repository names
  or URLs.
